Usurpers - Mayor's secretary and fire elemental~
There is a village south of here that was usurped by magic and evil.  How can a
mayor allow that?  Punish the mayor by slaying the mayor's secretary.  We do not
want the fire of this magic to spread.  There is a fire elemental secreted away
within this usurped village.  Extinguish this fire elemental.
~
Go to the usurped village and kill the mayor's secretary and fire elemental.
~
