#12217
Dragonor Keep Flower, Beetle, Golem & Fire elemental~
Dragonor Keep lies near the child like Enfans.  The keep is full of mysteries,
enigmas and corpse.  You are to venture there and fell 3 foes and 1 triviality
for me.  There is a giant Flower there.  Prune it!  There are several Golems.  
Slay one.  There is a Fire Elemental.  Extinguish it.  And there is a beetle.  
Stomp it!  Return to me with their heads and their items for I want to know
these trinkets are good for.
~
Go to Dragonor Keep and prune the Flower, slay the Golem, extinguish the Fire Elemental and stomp the Beetle.
~
